9. ASYMPTOTIC CONSISTENCY CHECK
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A genuine p=1 regime should show BOTH:

    p_eff -> 1

and

    C_T = T D(T) -> constant.

The two diagnostics are independent views of the same
scaling behaviour.

